{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And now.</b> Since it was not proper for you to leave without permission and to steal my heart by departing." "<b>You have indeed gone, because you sorely longed for your father's house.</b> It must be granted that you departed in this manner on account of your overwhelming desire to return to your father's house — and let it be so." "<b>Why have you stolen my elohim?</b> For in this there is no defense: your longing for your father's house was not the reason for your stealing my elohim."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:47.373156319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}